                  "headline": "SSW swell on the fade. Best surf early as size still decent. Light S/SW winds through the AM. ",
                  "observation": "Best size and conditions expected early as we will likely still see some Overhead+ surf for the southern exposures and magnets as the tide pushes in. The SSW swell is on the fade as we expect some energy to drop out limiting options and quality into the afternoon session as SSE winds pick up and set in. Still a fun wave should be found through the first part of the day. ",
