                  "human": true,
                  "dayToWatch": false,
                  "headline": "Fading energy continues. Chest to head high. Light winds early. Stronger SSE later. ",
                  "observation": "Less energy, less size and likely a few less options available. Winds are again looking light from the S through the early session, so make the most of the fun head high+ surf heading into the mid morning high tide. Afternoon session likely a little underwhelming with exposures possibly topping out in the shoulder high region under moderate SSE wind flow. ",
